id=hy320_no_vendor_settings
name=HY320: vendor settings app removed
version=v1
versionCode=1
author=owner
description=Hides the vendor settings app (com.htc.htcsettings), which carries Baidu analytics with the serial and MAC address, and a RecoverySystem update path, and runs as the system so its network cannot be blocked. Nothing in any partition is changed: removing this module brings the app straight back.
